rmal;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">少年マガジンさん</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">齊藤京子さんと表紙をやらせていただきました！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">初めて1期さんと2人で撮影だし、京子さんだったし♪</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">東京の各所を回って撮影をしたのですが、初めて東京タワーに登ったり、本当に楽しかったです✨</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2018-11-20/26790_1.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_6668.jpeg\"></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font